      (:code "(define f (lambda (x) (* x x)))\n(define tl (calc/tangent-line f 3))\n(< (abs (- (car tl) 6)) 0.01)" :tags (math program))
      (:code "(define (tangent-slope f a) (car (calc/tangent-line f a)))\n(map (lambda (a) (tangent-slope (lambda (x) (* x x)) a)) (list 0 1 2))" :tags (cs program))))
    (:problem "Newton's method needs the tangent line at a point; a plot annotator also needs a callable tangent for drawing."
